msgid "Provides a way for extensions to register eager security interceptor. For example, the Vert.x HTTP extension registers `HttpAuthenticationMechanism` and an interceptor that sets annotation value ('@HttpAuthenticationMechanism(\"basic\") => 'basic') as routing context attribute. With disabled proactive authentication, these interceptors are guaranteed to run before any other security code of supported extensions (currently RESTEasy Classic and RESTEasy Reactive)."
